  "external_title": "Getting Started",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Welcome to Pandamium!",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "dark_green"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Getting Started",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "gold"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "white"
        },
        {
          "text": "Random Teleporter\n",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use /trigger rtp to teleport to a random location in the wilderness. The teleporter chooses a location within 25,000 blocks of spawn in the X and Z directions.\n\n",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "Choosing a Base\n",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "For a long-term base, consider building outside the RTP range. The farther you are from spawn, the less likely your base is to be stumbled upon by another player.\n\n",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nether Travel\n",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Nether can be used to travel large distances quickly. A portal at spawn provides access to the Nether, allowing you to travel far beyond the Overworld RTP range.\n\n",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "Getting Settled\n",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "Once you find a good location, use /trigger sethome to save it. You can then use /trigger home to return to your base later."
          ,
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    }
  ],
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "after_action": "none",
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "translate": "gui.back"
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:run_command",
      "command": "trigger help"
    }
  }
}